{"id":4554,"date":"2024-04-26T03:14:00","date_gmt":"2024-04-26T03:14:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/?p=4554"},"modified":"2024-04-26T04:20:40","modified_gmt":"2024-04-26T04:20:40","slug":"niem-vui-cho-em-du-an-thien-nguyen-y-nghia-cua-angeline","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/niem-vui-cho-em-du-an-thien-nguyen-y-nghia-cua-angeline\/","title":{"rendered":"Ni\u1ec1m Vui Cho Em &#8211; D\u1ef1 \u00c1n Thi\u1ec7n Nguy\u1ec7n \u00dd Ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a Angeline"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8220;<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/niem-vui-cho-em-du-an-thien-nguyen-y-nghia-cua-angeline\/\">Ni\u1ec1m vui cho em<\/a><\/strong>&#8221; l\u00e0 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh t\u1eeb thi\u1ec7n do <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/\">Angeline<\/a><\/strong> v\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, v\u1edbi mong mu\u1ed1n \u0111em \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng s\u1ef1 \u1ee7ng h\u1ed9, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nho nh\u1ecf v\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t tinh th\u1ea7n v\u00e0 v\u1eadt ch\u1ea5t cho c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf c\u00f3 ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t t\u1ea1i &#8220;Nh\u00e0 Nu\u00f4i d\u01b0\u1ee1ng Tr\u1ebb em H\u1eefu ngh\u1ecb Qu\u1eadn \u0110\u1ed1ng \u0110a &#8211; H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i&#8221;, mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho c\u00e1c em nh\u1eefng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u00e0nh m\u1ea1nh c\u00f9ng nh\u1eefng nh\u1eefng ph\u1ea7n qu\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft th\u1ef1c, s\u01b0\u1edfi \u1ea5m tr\u00e1i tim c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf trong ng\u00e0y sinh nh\u1eadt c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4573\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-14.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-14.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-14-569x400.jpg 569w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-14-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-14-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-14-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-14-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-14-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4570\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-11.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-11.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-11-569x400.jpg 569w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-11-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-11-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-11-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-11-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-11-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cNi\u1ec1m Vui Cho Em\u201d b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t n\u1ed7i ni\u1ec1m nh\u1ecf b\u00e9 lu\u00f4n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u1ea5p \u1ee7 trong tim c\u1ee7a r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u tr\u1ebb em n\u00f3i chung v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf c\u00f3 ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh kh\u00f3. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh b\u1ea1n nh\u1ecf say m\u00ea l\u00e0m \u0111i l\u00e0m l\u1ea1i h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u1ed5i t\u1eaft n\u1ebfn tr\u00ean chi\u1ebfc b\u00e1nh sinh nh\u1eadt, h\u00e1o h\u1ee9c v\u00ec s\u1eafp \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00e0y sinh nh\u1eadt. \u0110\u00f4i khi ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n l\u00e0 l\u01b0\u1edbt qua m\u1ed9t khung h\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t b\u1eefa ti\u1ec7c sinh nh\u1eadt c\u0169ng l\u00e0m c\u00e1c b\u00e9 r\u1ed9n r\u00e0ng n\u00f4n nao. Nh\u1eefng c\u1ea3m x\u00fac ch\u00e2n ch\u1ea5t b\u00ecnh d\u1ecb theo n\u0103m th\u00e1ng ph\u1ea3i n\u00e9n ch\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i b\u00ean trong tr\u00e1i tim nh\u1ecf b\u00e9.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4571\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-12.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-12.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-12-569x400.jpg 569w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-12-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-12-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-12-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-12-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-12-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">C\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn nh\u1eefng rung \u0111\u1ed9ng m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd t\u1eeb c\u00e1c b\u1ea1n nh\u1ecf, \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 Angeline<\/span> c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u00e3 tri\u1ec3n khai ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh thi\u1ec7n nguy\u1ec7n \u201cNi\u1ec1m Vui Cho Em\u201d v\u1edbi mong mu\u1ed1n \u0111em l\u1ea1i ti\u1ec7c sinh nh\u1eadt nh\u1ecf xinh \u0111\u1ebfn cho c\u00e1c b\u00e9 c\u00f3 ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n. \u0110\u00fang v\u1edbi t\u00ean g\u1ecdi \u201cNi\u1ec1m Vui Cho Em\u201d \u2013 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh hi v\u1ecdng \u0111em v\u1ec1 th\u1eadt nhi\u1ec1u nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc vui v\u1ebb trong tu\u1ed5i th\u01a1 c\u00e1c em, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 th\u1eafp l\u00ean ng\u1ecdn l\u1eeda th\u01b0\u01a1ng y\u00eau, s\u01b0\u1edfi \u1ea5m nh\u1eefng tr\u00e1i tim b\u00e9 nh\u1ecf.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4572\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-13.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-13.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-13-569x400.jpg 569w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-13-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-13-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-13-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-13-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-13-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>V\u1edbi slogan &#8220;Mang ni\u1ec1m vui \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi thi\u00ean th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n&#8221;, Hoàng Lâm Decor kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u00f4ng qua nh\u1eefng s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u00fd ngh\u0129a m\u00e0 c\u00f2n k\u00eau g\u1ecdi s\u1ef1 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00f3 t\u00e2m, nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng c\u00f9ng nhau x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc cho th\u1ebf h\u1ec7 mai sau.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4563\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\