ontent\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-9-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-9-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-9-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-9-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4566\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-7.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-7-569x400.jpg 569w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-7-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-7-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-7-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-7-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-7-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4569\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-10.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-10-569x400.jpg 569w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-10-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-10-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-10-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-10-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-10-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4565\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-6.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-6-569x400.jpg 569w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-6-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-6-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-6-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-6-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/niem-vui-cho-em-6-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>H\u00e3y tham gia v\u1edbi Hoàng Lâm Decor \u0111\u1eb7t n\u1ec1n m\u00f3ng cho t\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n mong mu\u1ed1n g\u1eedi g\u1eafm. M\u1ed7i s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, m\u1ed7i ph\u1ea7n qu\u00e0, m\u1ed7i ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng vui ch\u01a1i l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh l\u1edbn l\u00ean c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c em, v\u00e0 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a s\u1ee9 m\u1ec7nh m\u00e0 ch\u00fang ta \u0111\u1ed3ng l\u00f2ng h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1edbi.<br \/>\nChi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch &#8220;Ni\u1ec1m vui cho em&#8221; \u0111em ni\u1ec1m vui v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 \u1ea5m \u00e1p t\u1edbi &#8220;L\u00e0ng tr\u1ebb em BIRLA H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i&#8221;, &#8220;L\u00e0ng tr\u1ebb em SOS H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i&#8221;, &#8220;Nh\u00e0 nu\u00f4i d\u01b0\u1ee1ng tr\u1ebb em H\u1eefu Ngh\u1ecb \u0110\u1ed1ng \u0110a&#8221;, &#8220;Trung t\u00e2m b\u1ea3o tr\u1ee3 x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i III H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i&#8221;, &#8220;B\u1ec7nh vi\u1ec7n tim H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i&#8221;, v\u00e0 &#8220;B\u1ec7nh vi\u1ec7n Nhi Trung \u01b0\u01a1ng s\u1ebd duy tr\u00ec h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng, v\u1edbi t\u00ean g\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ee7 n\u00f3i l\u00ean t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3. Nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1ec1 tinh th\u1ea7n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u1edbi c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n g\u1eedi g\u1eafm th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p s\u1ebb chia c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng tr\u00e1i tim \u1ea5m \u00e1p t\u00ecnh ng\u01b0\u1eddi trong c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i.<\/p>\n<div class=\"box__cont\">\n<div class=\"boxx__content__single\">\n<div class=\"box__nth_2\">\n<p>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<\/p>\n<p>\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc04 \u2013 \ud835\udc04\ud835\udc15\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc13 \ud835\udc0f\ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11<br \/>\n<em>Mang ni\u1ec1m vui \u0111\u1ebfn thi\u00ean th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n<\/em><br \/>\n\u2022 Address:\u00a0<strong>20 Ng\u00f5 176 L\u00ea Tr\u1ecdng T\u1ea5n, Thanh Xu\u00e2n, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/strong><br \/>\n\u2022 Hotline:\u00a0<strong>0986897655 \u2013 0976830880<\/strong><br \/>\n\u2022 Fanpage:\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Angeline.event.planner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https: \/\/www.facebook.com\/Angeline.event.planner<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\n\u2022 Pinterest:\u00a0<strong><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n xd10rxx x1sy0etr x17r0tee x972fbf xcfux6l x1qhh985 xm0m39n x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266